    "滚动状态"
  ],
  "summary": "支付当前台阶费用后可向上爬一或两级，可从下标 0 或 1 开始，求到达楼顶的最小花费。",
  "insight": "到达位置 i 的最小花费来自位置 i-1 加其费用，或位置 i-2 加其费用；楼顶视为下标 n 且无费用。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "起点可以选 0 或 1，因此 dp[0]=dp[1]=0",
    "支付的是离开台阶时对应费用",
    "只需保存前两个状态"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "rolling-two-step-dp",
      "title": "两步滚动最小费用",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "逐位置计算到达该位置的最低成本。",
      "steps": [
        "previousTwo=0、previousOne=0",
        "position 从 2 到 n，current=min(previousOne+cost[position-1],previousTwo+cost[position-2])",
        "滚动两状态，返回 previousOne"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n)",
        "space": "O(1)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/rolling-two-step-dp/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/rolling-two-step-dp/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/rolling-two-step-dp/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
}
